{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605140/extras/ENG-Header_StayAlive.png?t=1749056130\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the general motto of the Reclaimers. Special people, who are beyond control of the concept of death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605140/extras/123213123213.gif?t=1749056130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605140/extras/ENG-Header_Extract.png?t=1749056130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They will reward you, provide you with quests and improve your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605140/extras/gif10.gif?t=1749056130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605140/extras/ENG-Header_Meh.png?t=1749056130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A friendlier TTK (time to kill). Less realism in ballistics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605140/extras/gif12.gif?t=1749056130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605140/extras/ENG-Header_Free.png?t=1749056130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No more prepared building slots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605140/extras/Build_1.gif?t=1749056130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605140/extras/ENG-Header_Tet.png?t=1749056130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The chests are expanding the storage space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605140/extras/ENG-Header_Prog.png?t=1749056130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The experience you receive  is defined by your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605140/extras/ENG-Header_Wipes.png?t=1749056130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yes, no wipes!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3605140?t=1749056130","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605140/ab26fd2613f35a7581cc20eaf7955d2c758ea15e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749056130","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605140/c120233f0ffe2bcfa0e1c05e9e9adc3ad59ac498/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749056130","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605140/c120233f0ffe2bcfa0e1c05e9e9adc3ad59ac498/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749056130","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>WISHLIST \u21e8 PLAYTEST</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605140/extras/Discord-\u2014-ExWays---v8,-by-Ars,-May-2025.gif?t=1749056130\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605140/extras/ENG-Header_StayAlive.png?t=1749056130\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the general motto of the Reclaimers. Special people, who are beyond control of the concept of death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605140/extras/123213123213.gif?t=1749056130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605140/extras/ENG-Header_Extract.png?t=1749056130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They will reward you, provide you with quests and improve your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605140/extras/gif10.gif?t=1749056130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605140/extras/ENG-Header_Meh.png?t=1749056130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A friendlier TTK (time to kill). Less realism in ballistics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605140/extras/gif12.gif?t=1749056130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605140/extras/ENG-Header_Free.png?t=1749056130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No more prepared building slots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605140/extras/Build_1.gif?t=1749056130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605140/extras/ENG-Header_Tet.png?t=1749056130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The chests are expanding the storage space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605140/extras/ENG-Header_Prog.png?t=1749056130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The experience you receive  is defined by your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605140/extras/ENG-Header_Wipes.png?t=1749056130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yes, no wipes!</p>","developers":["ASKES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605140/ac02cbb767922672f16f4acb0a9fd1139fd23c4d/header.jpg?t=1749056130","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257145004,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145004/movie480.mp4?t=1748624916","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145004/movie_max.mp4?t=1748624916"},"name":"Exit Ways \u2014 Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257145004/117c53f783e303f068ce4635eb87359f3e9a9a51/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748624916","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145004/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748624916","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145004/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748624916"}}],"name":"Exit Ways","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":